__pycache__/
*.cpython-*.pyc
*.cpython-*.pyo
.env
*.pickle
.superpowers/

# Runtime data, not source. data/ holds bind-mount targets and caches: the
# sam-training subdirectory alone is 4.4 GB of NCC sweep caches and Hugging Face
# model weights, and Parra-Data / Martin-Data are mount points for the data disk
# and the NAS. None of it is reproducible from the repo, and none of it belongs
# in it — one `git add -A` would otherwise try to commit the lot, and a blob that
# size is effectively permanent once pushed.
#
# Written as `data/*` rather than `data/` so the exception below can work: git
# does not descend into an ignored DIRECTORY, so a negation inside one is never
# reached. Re-including a file therefore means un-ignoring each parent first.
data/*

# The one checked-in fixture the tests read.
!data/test/
data/test/*
!data/test/config.toml
